  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "爲什麼我會失眠呢？",
      "output_sha256": "44786d711231668d6092ed960e7ba42af722fe89203ffd7ad653a14c883071d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.693333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba96f5c7b53b55e0dbb32aaf71fe8202681a610df85e3de5864c7ad5919964b9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44786d711231668d6092ed960e7ba42af722fe89203ffd7ad653a14c883071d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "煩躁，噁心，心跳，膽小，並且想要哭泣。",
      "output_sha256": "220fbaa7bc4457e707bea1f8707c5005e1a658431920b05fbb319404134abe02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "220fbaa7bc4457e707bea1f8707c5005e1a658431920b05fbb319404134abe02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想想，也許就是故鄉的思慮罷。",
      "output_sha256": "ce5687abfaa3677d9a3eb830338484afece177c683c2278ddcb89a4a6df0b1c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce5687abfaa3677d9a3eb830338484afece177c683c2278ddcb89a4a6df0b1c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "窗子外面的天空高遠了，和白棉一樣綿軟的雲彩低近了，吹來的風好像帶點草原的氣味，這就是說已經是秋天了。",
      "output_sha256": "d1a0c4651fc4b6e2c8d21895a6cc3e7ef266e643f70230a3a38243333389bde0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1a0c4651fc4b6e2c8d21895a6cc3e7ef266e643f70230a3a38243333389bde0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在我的故鄉，秋天是最美好的季節。",
      "output_sha256": "b32b6b18068837bb14d21625039e7deaadf2077164a503245e7341b878527d22",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.369643,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a00ad060a4a466b6eba083dacbd6991c9b6608e717e568786cf22cc7a4698dd3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b32b6b18068837bb14d21625039e7deaadf2077164a503245e7341b878527d22",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那藍天有些發黑，白雲如同銀製的飾品，仿佛是盛開的白花點綴於天際；又像是沉重的雲朵即將脫離天空而掉落，這樣的景象使得天空顯得更加高遠，似乎再也沒有更高的地方了。",
      "output_sha256": "c270734a709d56b3156834228cc90ca9bfacdacceeb235e2f5f2326cde7f44d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.45804,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b1247bfff498a6035ce5f8884e9f8d085d3f6ece4a610d472ace4032a8af7c21"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c270734a709d56b3156834228cc90ca9bfacdacceeb235e2f5f2326cde7f44d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "昨天我去朋友那裡走了一遭，聽到了許多心願（那無數的心願合在一起，其實都是一個心願）。",
      "output_sha256": "2f086cf30de91bcbcc4273c12ec26d483ec2168d76b2e7c4b40342f83cc1e173",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.586303,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7a2bee10cfd4d63657510dba8595ce2618b6a0d4bf953bda8a93ba619e20a2fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f086cf30de91bcbcc4273c12ec26d483ec2168d76b2e7c4b40342f83cc1e173",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這回若真的打回滿洲去，有的說，煮一鍋高粱米粥喝；有的說，咱家那地豆多麼大！",
      "output_sha256": "3c5e616c0edebfaafe60ddeee57f99ee6acff9406bf5eab8744bb7cb6fba5da6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c5e616c0edebfaafe60ddeee57f99ee6acff9406bf5eab8744bb7cb6fba5da6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "說着就用手比量着，這麼碗大；珍珠米，老的一煮就開了花的，一尺來長的；還有的說，高粱米粥、鹹鹽豆。",
      "output_sha256": "2f0459ac009b378de7ecb3e8c02ce113083b044cfaab74170cbe586eb00c5ed7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f0459ac009b378de7ecb3e8c02ce113083b044cfaab74170cbe586eb00c5ed7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "還有的說，若真的打回滿洲去，三天二夜不吃飯，打着大旗往家跑。",
      "output_sha256": "b16c5830900a8ac0730e6c0f0bcd22bf3ee3dffa850a7c23ba28bba926d54ba4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "b16c5830900a8ac0730e6c0f0bcd22bf3ee3dffa850a7c23ba28bba926d54ba4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "跑到家去自然也免不了先吃高粱米粥或鹹鹽豆。",
      "output_sha256": "8711f533dca627876bce407630d5216bbe975a132b0279b8673c8ef7c45bc530",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "8711f533dca627876bce407630d5216bbe975a132b0279b8673c8ef7c45bc530",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "就拿高粱米來說，我平時是很少吃的，因爲口感硬且澀（或許是因爲我有胃病的緣故），但聽他們這麼一說，反而覺得非吃不可了。",
      "output_sha256": "0172de8b8424d5c165a1f3b2f13b9a1a10dc388d9478b4f6b91ee2ecd2d5bab1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.523247,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a06d8a76e6320d04fb8ee329d07d8a43e1cea9c561fbcea38962f0e6e992eeb4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0172de8b8424d5c165a1f3b2f13b9a1a10dc388d9478b4f6b91ee2ecd2d5bab1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是什麼時候吃呢？",
      "output_sha256": "dbab8eac6e61fad33f67db450908839f16cbff0f296174aedd9142333aea32e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbab8eac6e61fad33f67db450908839f16cbff0f296174aedd9142333aea32e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那我就不知道了。",
      "output_sha256": "906223abe37c3a9e8766102b04fd9371501f57416bb5be814f3f4dfbc3f677ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "906223abe37c3a9e8766102b04fd9371501f57416bb5be814f3f4dfbc3f677ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而況我到底是不怎樣熱烈的，所以關於這一方面，我終究不怎樣親切。",
      "output_sha256": "ccc03286f6e4f235375a1e0084c83ee92e85f022fa8b623e6bd85f60e168cd96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "ccc03286f6e4f235375a1e0084c83ee92e85f022fa8b623e6bd85f60e168cd96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，我常常想起我們門前的蒿草，後院裡開著的紫色茄子花，以及黃瓜攀附在架子上的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "d75d25086e3ea3307c5413f4e4f5debd2ac423d6edef642c6a04766d0ec27413",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.479155,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8df323325a37c8bd37a98379d67fedd81f1092bba2b0eab460d00c498c4adaca"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d75d25086e3ea3307c5413f4e4f5debd2ac423d6edef642c6a04766d0ec27413",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而那清早，朝陽帶着露珠一齊來了！",
      "output_sha256": "fc18f5d0da65628eefdb58ec0a0162f415ae381cd61ed1c93d5b46a11dc6a829",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc18f5d0da65628eefdb58ec0a0162f415ae381cd61ed1c93d5b46a11dc6a829",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我一說到蒿草或黃瓜，三郎就向我擺手或搖頭：“不，我們家，門前是兩棵柳樹，樹蔭交織着做成門形。",
      "output_sha256": "d6da1c63e4608bf57ec2f11dc59c7cb02ff0eb5a784b7bb8dcca3d6c2587612d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6da1c63e4608bf57ec2f11dc59c7cb02ff0eb5a784b7bb8dcca3d6c2587612d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再前面是菜園，過了菜園就是山。",
      "output_sha256": "f51292257df2a5c231ddd55ef13e8abc6cced1c423316620c83d3ff029183102",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "f51292257df2a5c231ddd55ef13e8abc6cced1c423316620c83d3ff029183102",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那金字塔形的山峯正向着我們家的門口，而兩邊像蝙蝠的翅膀似的向着村子的東方和西方伸展開去。",
      "output_sha256": "dde2df783c6773aabdc4d87bcc250d0ff5342ec1ab2428ed8d0fec7714b508eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "dde2df783c6773aabdc4d87bcc250d0ff5342ec1ab2428ed8d0fec7714b508eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而後院的黃瓜與茄子也在生長，最美的還是牽牛花在石牆的縫隙中爬滿，清晨時分牽牛花帶著露水綻放……”",
      "output_sha256": "f25b360f2a6bfc117ab93a52ace2f59ab8362e6798af8873d30c1d3c8fde7a54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.531715,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3af74279ab76836a9a8cb6cf3eeafa1fa815644048e703cfbe63f6fd265dea44"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f25b360f2a6bfc117ab93a52ace2f59ab8362e6798af8873d30c1d3c8fde7a54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我們家可不是這樣的，沒有高山，也沒有柳樹……只有……”我經常這樣打斷他。",
      "output_sha256": "f31883cca2521afe929140379ad25691ee2de0d7f259cbf3f3c86e8f05c8d3a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.77523,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "886a1a99388844024280fcef3b39d30e2b0224bd4f1d116f1aa4264a7ae2ce90"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f31883cca2521afe929140379ad25691ee2de0d7f259cbf3f3c86e8f05c8d3a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有時候，他甚至不等我說完，就接著談下去。",
      "output_sha256": "7712862c32df411d2b4f56770ab08cc24f838b5dad067365aeec7d00de9361de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.695667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c7238b0fa16ea0c015363a0ec46f1fbaa9089d8ba10c770ec9338d1bc454b2fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7712862c32df411d2b4f56770ab08cc24f838b5dad067365aeec7d00de9361de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我們講的故事，彼此都好像是講給自己聽，而不是爲着對方。",
      "output_sha256": "771af96f0a2e5a0716dcb7bb9e2c98fd389e089b8a3dd039ee6f765414a08b53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "771af96f0a2e5a0716dcb7bb9e2c98fd389e089b8a3dd039ee6f765414a08b53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有一天，他買來了一幅《東北富源圖》掛在牆上，畫中金黃色的平原上有小馬、小羊，還有駱駝與牽著駱駝的小人；海面上游著小魚、大魚，黃色的魚、紅色的如同小瓶的大肚魚，還有黑色的大鯨魚；興安嶺和遼寧一帶則是描繪了如海浪般的綠色山脈。",
      "output_sha256": "3cc578698bd6529cb6a8bf4d49bb4c1a7605139287869e991175c60c392b8dc5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.68193,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c4090b49cb7eedc85190b4caddc10c2ff03bccf549923eb995a8af9e11a9c781"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3cc578698bd6529cb6a8bf4d49bb4c1a7605139287869e991175c60c392b8dc5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的家就在離着渤海不遠的山脈中，他的指甲在山脈上爬着：“這是大淩河……這是小淩河……哼……沒有，這個地圖是個不完全的，是個略圖……”",
      "output_sha256": "079963753498dc5fa110baeebe487995b6bb36eb9770c1df6271b5a5d12d5df0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "079963753498dc5fa110baeebe487995b6bb36eb9770c1df6271b5a5d12d5df0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“好哇！",
      "output_sha256": "6966e9820c8e997156ee4445d08701f5bf326c4bb67db8f5f16430c7ee8ebc29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "6966e9820c8e997156ee4445d08701f5bf326c4bb67db8f5f16430c7ee8ebc29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "天天提到淩河，卻根本沒有淩河！”",
      "output_sha256": "052c8fdb0172f932bbefc32f2d373826fe91e2e974b2f25cd88aebda13042cb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.509009,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d57ba33c56449141005e9ad102ba0599d730f72ecafbf8dc7d2956f59946b5a0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "052c8fdb0172f932bbefc32f2d373826fe91e2e974b2f25cd88aebda13042cb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不知爲什麼一提到家鄉，常常願意給他掃興一點。",
      "output_sha256": "a6096218d392cfff8f6ea406cb3c53bfad22521acbb6309d81d7734cbec92caa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "a6096218d392cfff8f6ea406cb3c53bfad22521acbb6309d81d7734cbec92caa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你不相信！",
      "output_sha256": "1b39d54a3e43234f05f28cdcb8882ef5b308532ed76ed4d78a47d702d0ec545c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b39d54a3e43234f05f28cdcb8882ef5b308532ed76ed4d78a47d702d0ec545c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我給你看。”",
      "output_sha256": "d966bc82ab293f6013eb0b35c04c5b029e9ed378afedc3ee58fa1e607ce3ed60",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "d966bc82ab293f6013eb0b35c04c5b029e9ed378afedc3ee58fa1e607ce3ed60",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他去翻他的書櫥，“這不是大淩河……小淩河……小時候在淩河邊上抓小魚，然後帶到山上，用火烤著吃……這就是沈家臺，離我們家兩里路……”因爲是把地圖攤在地板上看，他一邊說著，一邊用手撥弄著已經垂下的髮梢。",
      "output_sha256": "3e06dae9328d659860e2c7f2863849645d05938384881e62ae76a6f5d097f7fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.662535,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8dc9078a1c1538c856c64b1f69d5175b13cf0083306841f916d91190dcfb6272"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3e06dae9328d659860e2c7f2863849645d05938384881e62ae76a6f5d097f7fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "《東北富源圖》就掛在牀頭，所以第二天早晨，我一張開了眼睛，他就抓住了我的手：",
      "output_sha256": "532b3f43932db9f9e991f926cbe9072209a020e18b14274a54fef83ee15dd42b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "532b3f43932db9f9e991f926cbe9072209a020e18b14274a54fef83ee15dd42b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“我想將來我回家的時候，先買兩匹驢，一匹你騎着，一匹我騎着……先到我姑姑家，再到我姐姐家……順便也許看看我的舅舅去……我姐姐很愛我……她出嫁以後，每回來一次就哭一次，姐姐一哭，我也哭……這有七八年不見了！",
      "output_sha256": "a3a1ab8b9df2fb3d6af1fa44ec46536cbf48aaefa1b37dd983b85aaaebabeb36",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3a1ab8b9df2fb3d6af1fa44ec46536cbf48aaefa1b37dd983b85aaaebabeb36",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也都老了。”",
      "output_sha256": "4aafca34cb0b5388a28ad2e1951a820e26447518d4639f06bb79af40aaa68754",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "4aafca34cb0b5388a28ad2e1951a820e26447518d4639f06bb79af40aaa68754",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那地圖上的小魚，紅的，黑的，都能夠看清，我一邊看着，一邊聽着，這一次我沒有打斷他，或給他掃一點興。",
      "output_sha256": "3ceeeb47cb4715b9b218f4f6c286756c67f21bceb685db99705c16c87aa5a58e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ceeeb47cb4715b9b218f4f6c286756c67f21bceb685db99705c16c87aa5a58e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“買黑色的驢，掛着鈴子，走起來……噹啷啷噹啷啷……”他形容着鈴音的時候，就像他的嘴裏邊含着鈴子似的在響。",
      "output_sha256": "c90ac44fb5410027e1a5c304a0b2e9dca8f013684e365a7aa66972151cdcd918",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "c90ac44fb5410027e1a5c304a0b2e9dca8f013684e365a7aa66972151cdcd918",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我帶你去沈家臺趕集。",
      "output_sha256": "0d9bb3dc08ebd5bdd715110d1e9a15b4a87ff21d18dbad8013e647ae309f4ecb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.708947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "06881e0ab850cb25d9bf7f8053015953439a47a0caa68ed7d1be9b657c749ce5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d9bb3dc08ebd5bdd715110d1e9a15b4a87ff21d18dbad8013e647ae309f4ecb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那集市的日子熱鬧得很！",
      "output_sha256": "a93083726a7ac1f96863773304b375641c1dd20b9701d6799cd16ba3eb84bf06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1dbec7f9d73d7dbe42f0fde5c3685c69307a643e696cfc2a803fb7db16fe6a11"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a93083726a7ac1f96863773304b375641c1dd20b9701d6799cd16ba3eb84bf06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "驢子身上掛著酒瓶……我們那邊，羊肉特別便宜……羊肉燉片粉……真是好味道！",
      "output_sha256": "81dda1bab9fbbfe9cf69e736e0ed8da5095be692574c318c0e32a7e67a50d3c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.715,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0fb5a3a6abc0d315de5cf190be342e87628d9b7b52ed18169207cd30b89bc84e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "81dda1bab9fbbfe9cf69e736e0ed8da5095be692574c318c0e32a7e67a50d3c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唉呀！",
      "output_sha256": "2b6b88edc227c98ef2bba7f42c45f7235c0e10dba7135df4100f915344671cf8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "2b6b88edc227c98ef2bba7f42c45f7235c0e10dba7135df4100f915344671cf8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這多少年沒吃羊肉了！”",
      "output_sha256": "348df510a42aba7af04e3f96efd2f4ad797895a70f9dcf3549eba3f51b92a7d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.664021,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fb5a22ff26856f38b530d6650795055068dba48a4284b2c718da95b27a3857bf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "348df510a42aba7af04e3f96efd2f4ad797895a70f9dcf3549eba3f51b92a7d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他的眉頭上出現了許多皺紋。",
      "output_sha256": "016160098af9b669732988166897491566cae1768e6e7e0ca993587b14971273",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.552299,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7863d57b71dc841b8a0a0ccc3e439fa717b28449b199a4af820c4ec91ebbb41c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "016160098af9b669732988166897491566cae1768e6e7e0ca993587b14971273",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我在大鏡子裏邊看了他，他的手從我的手上抽回去，放在他自己的胸上，而後又揹着放在枕頭下面去，但很快地又抽出來。",
      "output_sha256": "e1a2e281d41941c64cfb7d63df74a47a7da2bf0f87df51f149f0174d55319b5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1a2e281d41941c64cfb7d63df74a47a7da2bf0f87df51f149f0174d55319b5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只理一理他自己的髮梢又放在枕頭上去。",
      "output_sha256": "b71df73ee933784793e87b10e024dd1dccaef92435fafc6976738c47da157f25",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "b71df73ee933784793e87b10e024dd1dccaef92435fafc6976738c47da157f25",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而我，我想：",
      "output_sha256": "a53e3203cf7e6304fa804bee26a8520e4ba269370bb07e4b89f52e99c8b04ecd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "a53e3203cf7e6304fa804bee26a8520e4ba269370bb07e4b89f52e99c8b04ecd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“你們家對於外來的所謂‘媳婦’也一樣嗎？”",
      "output_sha256": "ebef31b42be28ba91afdc3ebe36b649c7fdb4d383ccdedaf28ad18f1e8722203",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "ebef31b42be28ba91afdc3ebe36b649c7fdb4d383ccdedaf28ad18f1e8722203",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想着這樣說了。",
      "output_sha256": "72262a37eaf73370b161936aa8ebc0f9aa5fc0a6703fb63c8cf5d7f6a1d8f3a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "72262a37eaf73370b161936aa8ebc0f9aa5fc0a6703fb63c8cf5d7f6a1d8f3a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這失眠大概也許不是因爲這個。",
      "output_sha256": "680b7e93d879f8fac9f2cb6fb67861eec02ed45bf96d5f15b85d3e7bfa6c66d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "680b7e93d879f8fac9f2cb6fb67861eec02ed45bf96d5f15b85d3e7bfa6c66d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但是買驢子的，吃鹹鹽豆的，而我呢？",
      "output_sha256": "9e2e9e0b4477ae47c1efb02823f5aa58323ead4ee587d10ef43e5cdac643a171",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.685588,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5ac7562e7931944d3c64ce32b66fd171c5a68347d3a9f129b1e3273b65fc7a13"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e2e9e0b4477ae47c1efb02823f5aa58323ead4ee587d10ef43e5cdac643a171",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "坐在驢子上，所去的仍是生疏的地方，我停着的仍然是別人的家鄉。",
      "output_sha256": "fdc3f9bb91e72cb3f961780433d71f8b54597127fe439e8d7b4a8e325296c053",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "fdc3f9bb91e72cb3f961780433d71f8b54597127fe439e8d7b4a8e325296c053",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "家鄉這個觀念，在我本不甚切的，但當別人說起來的時候，我也就心慌了！",
      "output_sha256": "e89393c5140bd39a5b3cf32ed8cb04bd79bb8e69cb257ad2b4d770dfbe7c3600",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "e89393c5140bd39a5b3cf32ed8cb04bd79bb8e69cb257ad2b4d770dfbe7c3600",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雖然那塊土地在沒有成爲日本的之前，“家”在我就等於沒有了。",
      "output_sha256": "7cc19fd405efdf21773fc0f8ed4081ecb62fc831c91ec091ce731890a94b285d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "7cc19fd405efdf21773fc0f8ed4081ecb62fc831c91ec091ce731890a94b285d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這失眠一直繼續到黎明之前，在高射炮的聲中，我也聽到了一聲聲和家鄉一樣的震抖在原野上的雞鳴。",
      "output_sha256": "08c3cbaffa5b8000f014c2e1d6b991d5aad931cc3f2f197594d52eb51488eb41",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "08c3cbaffa5b8000f014c2e1d6b991d5aad931cc3f2f197594d52eb51488eb41",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
